    "Add to cart tried on 3 in-band items (USD 39.99, 159.99, 39.99): each time the button spun, a 'My Cart' drawer opened blank, and /cart then showed an empty cart. No visible error or challenge wording. Cause unknown (possibly a silent bot-management refusal of the add call, or the background tab).",
    "Evidence-1 was exported right after add attempt 1, before /cart showed the add had failed; it was first meant as minicart-1 and was moved to evidence. Evidence-2 is the product page after the third failed add.",
    "Clicks by ref on links in a carousel or listing (nav 4, 19) hit the viewport centre: the first did not navigate, and the second opened a different product (/p/67341940560, USD 343.99, out of band, not used). The intended products were then opened by their link href.",
    "Cookie banner had only a dismiss control; closed it (logged as popup-close).",
    "robots.txt disallows /s/ and /search but not /cart or a checkout path; root allowed."
  ],
